<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  body {
    {% if board_kind == "profit" %}
    --accent: #FF4F91;
    --accent-soft: rgba(255, 79, 145, 0.15);
    --accent-glow: rgba(255, 79, 145, 0.34);
    {% else %}
    --accent: #67E4F3;
    --accent-soft: rgba(103, 228, 243, 0.15);
    --accent-glow: rgba(103, 228, 243, 0.34);
    {% endif %}
    width: 780px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #F7F7F2;
    background: #090A0F;
    font-family: NTEFont, sans-serif;
  }
  .card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 88% 56%, var(--accent-soft), transparent 31%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #12131A 0, #090A0F 100%);
  }
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    height: 274px;
    padding: 26px 32px 28px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(5, 6, 10, 0.92) 0%, rgba(5, 6, 10, 0.55) 48%, rgba(5, 6, 10, 0.1) 78%),
      linear-gradient(0deg, #090A0F 0%, transparent 38%),
      url('{{ rank_bg }}');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center 43%;
  }
  .hero::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    right: 18px;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 18px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
    content: "";
  }
  .hero::after {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    height: 12px;
    background-color: #18191F;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(45deg, var(--accent) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, var(--accent) 75%),
      linear-gradient(45deg, var(--accent) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, var(--accent) 75%);
    background-position: 0 0, 6px 6px;
    background-size: 12px 12px;
    opacity: 0.8;
    content: "";
  }
  .hero-top,
  .hero-copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .hero-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .brand img {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .brand-copy {
    margin-left: 11px;
  }
  .brand-name {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .brand-code {
    margin-top: 2px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.54);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .tag {
    margin-left: 8px;
    padding: 7px 12px 6px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    background: rgba(8, 9, 14, 0.72);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .tag-accent {
    color: #090A0F;
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .hero-copy {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 34px;
    left: 32px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before {
    width: 34px;
    height: 3px;
    margin-right: 10px;
    background: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--accent-glow);
    content: "";
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 5px 0 0;
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-shadow: 0 3px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.86);
  }
  .period {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .content {
    position: relative;
    padding: 22px 30px 18px;
  }
  .content::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 24px;
    width: 126px;
    height: 42px;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--accent);
    border-right: 2px solid var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.5;
    content: "";
  }
  .summary {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
  }
  .summary-cell {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 11px 15px 10px;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }
  .summary-cell:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }
  .summary-label {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }
  .summary-value {
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .summary-value.accent {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .rank-row {
    --rank-color: var(--accent);
    --rank-soft: var(--accent-soft);
    --rank-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 98px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--rank-border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--rank-color);
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--rank-soft), transparent 26%),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
  }
  .rank-row::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 42px;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--rank-color);
    content: "";
  }
  .rank-row.rank-1 {
    --rank-color: #F6CF78;
    --rank-soft: rgba(246, 207, 120, 0.16);
    --rank-border: rgba(246, 207, 120, 0.42);
  }
  .rank-row.rank-2 {
    --rank-color: #C4CBD0;
    --rank-soft: rgba(196, 203, 208, 0.14);
    --rank-border: rgba(196, 203, 208, 0.38);
  }
  .rank-row.rank-3 {
    --rank-color: #B8754F;
    --rank-soft: rgba(184, 117, 79, 0.16);
    --rank-border: rgba(184, 117, 79, 0.42);
  }
  .rank-row.self {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    border-left-color: var(--rank-color);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--accent-glow), inset 0 0 28px var(--accent-soft);
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--rank-soft), transparent 42%),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.065);
  }
  .overflow-divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 20px 0 2px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .overflow-divider::before,
  .overflow-divider::after {
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--accent));
    content: "";
    flex: 1;
  }
  .overflow-divider::after {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), transparent);
  }
  .overflow-divider span {
    margin: 0 14px;
  }
  .rank-index {
    width: 64px;
    padding-left: 12px;
    color: var(--rank-color);
    font-size: 29px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }
  .rank-index span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: -3px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    font-size: 8px;
    font-style: normal;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .avatar-frame {
    position: relative;
    width: 62px;
    height: 62px;
    padding: 3px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    background: #11131A;
  }
  .avatar-frame::before,
  .avatar-frame::after {
    position: absolute;
    width: 13px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--accent);
    content: "";
  }
  .avatar-frame::before {
    top: -2px;
    left: -2px;
  }
  .avatar-frame::after {
    right: -2px;
    bottom: -2px;
  }
  .avatar {
    display: block;
    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .identity {
    width: 156px;
    padding: 0 13px;
  }
  .role-name {
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .uid {
    margin-top: 5px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.7px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .rank-row.self .role-name,
  .rank-row.self .uid {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .metrics {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1;
    align-items: stretch;
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }
  .metric {
    width: 75px;
    padding: 5px 7px;
  }
  .metric-label {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.38);
    font-size: 9px;
  }
  .metric-value {
    margin-top: 7px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .metric-value.rate {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .net {
    width: 132px;
    padding-right: 14px;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .net-label {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .net-value {
    margin-top: 5px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .empty {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 220px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 48%, var(--accent-soft) 49%, var(--accent-soft) 51%, transparent 52%),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
  }
  .empty-code {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
  }
  .empty-title {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .empty-note {
    margin-top: 7px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
    font-size: 10px;
  }
  .footer-checker {
    height: 8px;
    background-color: #15161C;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(45deg, var(--accent) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, var(--accent) 75%),
      linear-gradient(45deg, var(--accent) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, var(--accent) 75%);
    background-position: 0 0, 4px 4px;
    background-size: 8px 8px;
    opacity: 0.65;
  }
  .footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 54px;
    padding: 0 30px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    background: #07080C;
  }
  .footer img {
    width: 190px;
  }
  .footer span {
    flex: 1;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    text-align: right;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="hero-top">
        <div class="brand">
          <img src="{{ icon }}">
          <div class="brand-copy">
            <div class="brand-name">喵呜快报</div>
            <div class="brand-code">NTE · SCRATCH DATA UNIT</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tag">{{ scope_label }}排行</div>
        <div class="tag tag-accent">{{ label }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">{{ board_subtitle }}</div>
        <h1>{{ board_title }}</h1>
        <div class="period">RANK TIME / {{ period }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <div class="summary">
        <div class="summary-cell">
          <div class="summary-label">RANK SCOPE</div>
          <div class="summary-value">{{ scope_label }} · {{ label }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-cell">
          <div class="summary-label">SYNCED ACCOUNTS</div>
          <div class="summary-value">{{ account_total }} 个账号</div>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-cell">
          <div class="summary-label">BOARD ACCOUNTS</div>
          <div class="summary-value accent">{{ board_total }} 人符合</div>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-cell">
          <div class="summary-label">SCRATCH RECORDS</div>
          <div class="summary-value">{{ record_total }} 次</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {% if entries %}
      {% for entry in entries %}
      {% if entry.overflow %}
      <div class="overflow-divider"><span>当前账号未进入前 {{ rank_limit }} · 以下为真实名次</span></div>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="rank-row{% if entry.rank <= 3 %} rank-{{ entry.rank }}{% endif %}{% if entry.is_self %} self{% endif %}">
        <div class="rank-index"><span>NO.</span>{{ entry.rank_text }}</div>
        <div class="avatar-frame"><img class="avatar" src="{{ entry.avatar }}"></div>
        <div class="identity">
          <div class="role-name">{{ entry.role_name|e }}</div>
          <div class="uid">UID {{ entry.uid|e }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metrics">
          <div class="metric">
            <div class="metric-label">投入</div>
            <div class="metric-value">{{ entry.cost }}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric">
            <div class="metric-label">返还</div>
            <div class="metric-value">{{ entry.gain }}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric">
            <div class="metric-label">次数</div>
            <div class="metric-value">{{ entry.count }}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric">
            <div class="metric-label">收益率</div>
            <div class="metric-value rate">{{ entry.profit_rate }}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="net">
          <div class="net-label">{{ value_label }}</div>
          <div class="net-value">{{ entry.net }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
      <div class="empty">
        <div class="empty-code">NO RANK DATA / 00</div>
        <div class="empty-title">{{ empty_text }}</div>
        <div class="empty-note">本榜仅展示该统计时段内已同步且符合条件的账号</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="footer-checker"></div>
    <div class="footer">
      <img src="{{ footer }}">
      <span>数据来自完美世界客服中心 · 仅统计已同步刮刮乐记录</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
